  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "年輕人！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E748F154EBAFF01001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "年輕人，\n可以請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳配合一下嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E748F154EBAFF0C000A53EF4EE58ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B3914D54084E004E0B55CEFF1F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因為黏黏寶那件事盤查了<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳，\n還懷疑<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳，不好意思啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E070BA9ECF9ECF5BF690A34EF64E8B76E467E54E8600100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0C000A908461F7759100100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0C4E0D597D610F601D554A3002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊，我只是想跟<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳道歉\n才叫住<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF0C621153EA662F60F38DDF00100003110000FF01014F6059B390536B49000A624D53EB4F4F00100003110000FF01014F6059B376843002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我現在因為「密阿雷美術館搶劫案」，\n忙得很呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621173FE572856E070BA300C5BC6963F96F77F8E88539928643652AB6848300DFF0C000A5FD95F975F8854623002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是重大案件耶！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F91CD592768484EF68036FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我來協助妳",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F86535452A959B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不好意思，好像讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳誤會了。\n我說的只是個訓練而已啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D597D610F601DFF0C597D50CF8B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B38AA467034E863002000A62118AAA768453EA662F500B8A137DF4800C5DF255663002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷警察會定期進行訓練，\n這次設定的是美術館被當成目標的狀況。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F78B665BDF67035B9A671F9032884C8A137DF4FF0C000A90196B218A2D5B9A7684662F7F8E8853992888AB7576621076EE6A19768472C06CC13002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等等喔……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B497B49559420262026001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳來幫忙好了！\n畢竟警察阿姨我知道<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的實力嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F8B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B34F865E6B5FD9597D4E86FF01000A75627ADF8B665BDF963F59E8621177E5905300100003110000FF01014F6059B376845BE6529B561B3002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳扮演成搶匪，\n來襲擊密阿雷美術館吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B3626E6F1462106436532AFF0C000A4F86897264CA5BC6963F96F77F8E885399285427FF01001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳準備好了的話，\n就跟警察阿姨我說一聲。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B36E965099597D4E8676848A71FF0C000A5C318DDF8B665BDF963F59E862118AAA4E0080723002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳準備好要當搶匪……不對，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳準備好要裝成搶匪了嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B36E965099597D898175766436532A202620264E0D5C0DFF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B36E965099597D898188DD62106436532A4E8655CEFF1F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "準備好了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6E965099597D4E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這次的訓練是否成功，\n取決於<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳有多認真投入。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90196B2176848A137DF4662F54266210529FFF0C000A53D66C7A65BC00100003110000FF01014F6059B36709591A8A8D771F629551653002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，我們開始訓練吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C62115011958B59CB8A137DF454273002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要負責做的是\n從美術館入口進去，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n把在2樓展示的\n古代神奧人的衣服搶走。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n途中會有警察為了逮捕<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳\n而挑起對戰，所以要應戰喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過，要阻擋<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的警察們，\n可是從密阿雷警察局裡精挑細選的精英喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904EFF0C8981963B64CB00100003110000FF01014F6059B376848B665BDF5011FF0C000A53EF662F5F9E5BC6963F96F78B665BDF5C4088E17CBE63117D30907876847CBE82F155943002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳就從屋頂跳下，\n開始訓練吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C00100003110000FF01014F6059B35C315F9E5C4B98028DF34E0BFF0C000A958B59CB8A137DF454273002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳忘記訓練的路線了嗎？\n要從正面進入美術館。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B35FD88A188A137DF476848DEF7DDA4E8655CEFF1F000A89815F9E6B639762903251657F8E885399283002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0018>",
