      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "站住！\n要是不停下，我就要派出寶可夢！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就是這樣的訓練啦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
