      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "正面被闖入了！\n搶匪正朝你們那邊過去！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就是這樣的訓練啦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
