      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "繼正面之後，\n櫃台的警戒線也被闖入了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7E7C6B6397624E4B5F8CFF0C000A6AC353F076848B6662127DDA4E5F88AB95D651654E86FF0100100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖說是訓練，\n但要是輸了還是會被罵的……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
