    },
    {
      "displayText": "古代神奧人的衣服\n被稀世怪盜<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>偷走了。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n請設下包圍網，\n不要讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā他她逃出密阿雷市！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53E44EE3795E59674EBA76848863670D000A88AB7A004E16602A76DC001000020100000050778D704E86300200100001BE01000A8ACB8A2D4E0B5305570D7DB2FF0C000A4E0D89818B9300100003110000FF01014ED65979900351FA5BC6963F96F75E02FF0100100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然這場訓練很棒，\n但報告書很難寫呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D67136901958348A137DF45F8868D2FF0C000A4F465831544A66F85F8896E35BEB5462300200100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "下次開始的訓練\n好像會變得更吃力。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0B6B21958B59CB76848A137DF4000A597D50CF67038B8A5F9766F45403529B300200100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這一切不都是因為妳委託了\n實力太強的<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>來幫忙，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n是妳的責任不是嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194E0052074E0D90FD662F56E070BA59B359D48A174E86000A5BE6529B592A5F37768400100002010000004F865E6B5FD9FF0C00100001BE00000A662F59B376848CAC4EFB4E0D662F55CEFF1F00100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "既然發現了問題所在，\n就當作好事一樁吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E27136767C73FE4E86554F984C62405728FF0C000A5C3175764F5C597D4E8B4E006A0154273002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了守護密阿雷的安全，\n我們將用心更進一步加強警備。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E865B888B775BC6963F96F776845B895168FF0C000A621150115C0775285FC366F490324E006B6552A05F378B6650993002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，\n感謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的協助！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
